Modifications in this fork (high-level):
- HTTP transport support (streamable-http) for deployment behind an MCP gateway
- Container image rebuilt for HTTP-by-default operation (port 8000)
- Documentation, CI, and release tooling adapted for container deployment

This repository is intentionally disconnected from upstream — there is no
GitHub fork relationship. A local 'upstream' git remote pointing at
avivsinai/langfuse-mcp can be configured for occasional manual cherry-picks
of upstream changes.
